om (ctrl+End) ↓ [39m[49m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2C[1B[1mWhat carries over from the prompt rework[22m[K[2C[2BOnly two things:[K[2C[2B- [1mThe reranker.[22m Same[24Gcross-encoder,[39Gsame[44G0–1[48Gscale[54G—[56Gthat's[63Gwhat[68Gmakes[74Gprompt-vs-skill[90Gcomparison[101Glegitimate,[113Gand[117Git's[122Gthe[126Gchange[133GI[135Gjust[140Gmade.[2C[1B-[5G[1mMetadata filters.[23G[22m[38;2;177;185;249mdomain[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mintent[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mtask_type[47G[39mexist[53Gon[56G[38;2;177;185;249mskills.skills[70G[39mwith[75Gthe[79Gsame[84Gsemantics.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhat genuinely differs[22m[K[2C[2B[1m1. A[8Gskill has[18Gno body of its own.[38G[22mA[40Gprompt[47Gis[50Gauthored[59Gtext[64Gyou[68Gchunk.[75GA[77Gskill[83Gis[86Ga[88Gname,[94Ga[96Gone-line[105Gdescription,[118Gand[122G[3mpointers[23m.[132GIts[136Gretrievable[148Gtext[153Ghas[157Gto[160Gbe[163G[1mcomposed[172G[22m—[174G[38;2;177;185;249mname + routing_description + the summaries of its step prompts[39m.[238GThat's[245Ga[247Gbuild[2C[1Bstep[8Gprompts[16Gdon't[22Gneed,[28Gand[32Git[35Ghas[39Gto[42Gre-run[49Gwhen[54Gsteps[60Gchange.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1m2. Chunking doesn't apply.[22m Nothing to split. One record per skill,[70Gone[74Gvector.[82GThe[86Gwhole[92Gcascade[100Gsplitter,[110Gthe[114Gparent[121Grollup,[129G[38;2;177;185;249mchar_start[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mchar_end[149G[39m—[151Gnone[156Gof[159Git[162Gtransfers.[2C[2B[1m3[6GSix rows[15Gchanges[23Gthe mechanics.[38G[22mHNSW over[48G6 vectors is point[67Gess. Document-frequency st[94Gtistic[101G over 6 documents are meaningless — my [38;2;177;185;249mMAX_DF[39m term extract[160Gon would divide[176Gby[179Ga[181Gcorpus[188Gof[191Gsix.[196GJust[201Gbrute-force[213Gscore[219Gevery[225Gskill[231Gon[234Gevery[240Gquery;[247Git's[2C[1Bmicroseconds.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1m4. The cost of being wrong is asymmetric.[45G[22mA[47Gwrong[53Gprompt[60Gis[63Gtext[68Gyou[72Gskim[77Gand[81Gdiscard.[90GA[92Gwrong[98Gskill[104Gstarts[111Ga[113G[1mstateful multi-step workflow[142G[22m—[144G[38;2;177;185;249mskill_sessions[39m,[160G[38;2;177;185;249mstep_outputs[39m,[174Gaccumulated[186Gcontext,[195G24-hour[203Gexpiry.[211GSo[214Gskills[221Glegitimately[234Gdeserve[242Ga[244Ghigher[251Gbar[2C[1Bthan[8Gprompts.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BT[6Gt's not a walk-back[26Gof[29Gremoving[38G[38;2;177;185;249mSINGLE_THRESHOLD[39m.[56GWhat[61Gwas[65Gwrong[71Gthere[77Gwas[81Ggating[88Gskills[95Gon[98Ga[100G[3mprompt-scale[113G[23mscore[119Gfrom[124Ga[126Gdifferent[136Gmodel.[143GA[145Gmargin[152Gon[155Gthe[159Gskill's[167Gown[171Gcomparison[182G—[184G"only[190Gprefer[197Ga[199Gskill[205Gif[208Git[211Gbeats[217Gthe[221Gbest[226Gprompt[233Gby[236Gsome[241Gmargin"[249G—[251Gis[2C[1Bprincipled,[15Gbecause[23Git[26Gprices[33Gthe[37Gasymmetry.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1m5. Dedup is mandatory.[26G[22mA skill's steps [3mare[23m prompts[54Gin[57Gthe[61Gsame[66Gindex.[73GA[75Gquery[81Gmatching[90Gstep[95G2[97Gwill[102Gsurface[110Gboth[115Gthe[119Gskill[125Gand[129Gthat[134Gprompt.[142GYou[146Gneed[151Ga[153Grule:[159Gif[162Ga[164Gskill[170Gis[173Gserved,[181Gsuppress[190Gits[194Gown[198Gsteps[204Gfrom[209Gthe[213Gprompt[220Gresults.[2C[2B[1mThe design I'd ac[21Gually build[22m[K[2C[2BDon't give skills a parallel retrieval[42Gstack.[49G[1mDerive the skill signal from the prompt retrieval you already trust:[2C[2B[22m1. retr[11Geve + rerank p[26Gompts[32G         [42G (the strong index: 1025 rows, well-indexed)[K[2C[1B2.[6Gfor[10Geach[15Gskill,[22Gcount[28Ghow[32Gmany[37Gof[40Gits[44Gsteps[50Gappear[57Gin[60Gthe[64Gtop-k[2C[1B3[6Gskill_score = coverage × best_step_rerank_[49Gcore[K[2C[1B4[