[251Gbar[2C[1Bthan[8Gprompts.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThat's[10Gnot[14Ga[16Gwalk-back[26Gof[29Gremoving[38G[38;2;177;185;249mSINGLE_THRESHOLD[39m.[56GWhat[61Gwas[65Gwrong[71Gthere[77Gwas[81Ggating[88Gskills[95Gon[98Ga[100G[3mprompt-scale[113G[23mscore[119Gfrom[124Ga[126Gdifferent[136Gmodel.[143GA[145Gmargin[152Gon[155Gthe[159Gskill's[167Gown[171Gcomparison[182G—[184G"only[190Gprefer[197Ga[199Gskill[205Gif[208Git[211Gbeats[217Gthe[221Gbest[226Gprompt[233Gby[236Gsome[241Gmargin"[249G—[251Gis[2C[1Bprincipled, because it prices[33Gthe[37Gasymmetry.[2C[2B[1m5. Dedup is mandatory.[22m A skill's steps[42G[3mare[23m prompts in the same index. A query matching step 2 will surface both the[119Gskill[125Gand[129Gthat[134Gprompt.[142GYou[146Gneed[151Ga[153Grule:[159Gif[162Ga[164Gskill[170Gis[173Gserved,[181Gsuppress[190Gits[194Gown[198Gsteps[204Gfrom[209Gthe[213Gprompt[220Gresults.[2C[2B[1mThe design I'd actually build[43G[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BDon't give skills a parallel re[35Grieval st[45Gc[47G. [1mDerive the skill signal from the prompt retrieval you already trust:[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1B1[6Gretri[12Gve[15G+ rerank promp[30Gs [33G       [41G  (the st[51Gong in[58Gex: 1025[67Grows,[73Gwell-indexed)[2C[1B2.[6Gfor[10Geach[15Gskill,[22Gcount[28Ghow[32Gmany[37Gof[40Gits[44Gsteps[50Gappear[57Gin[60Gthe[64Gtop-k[2C[1B3. skill_score =[20Gcover[26Gg[29G× best_step_rerank_score[K[2C[1B4. serve the skil[21G only[27Gif[30Git[33Gbeats[39Gthe[43Gbest[48Gprompt[55Gby[58Ga[60Gmargin[2C[1B5.[6Gsuppress[15Gthat[20Gskill's[28Gstep[33Gprompts[41Gfrom[46Gthe[50Greturned[59Glist[2C[1B[K[2C[1BTwo[7Gprompts[15Gfrom[20Gthe[24Gsame[29Gskill[35Glanding[43Gin[46Gyour[51Gtop-10[58Gis[61Gfar[65Gstronger[74Gevidence[83Gthan[88Ga[90Gone-line[99G[38;2;177;185;249mrouting_description[119G[39mscoring[127G0.7[131Gagainst[139