is database from a backup,[47Gor[50Grun[54G[38;2;177;185;249minsert_prompts_batch[75G[39mwith[80Gits[84Gdefault[92G[38;2;177;185;249mprune_orphans=True[111G[39magain,[118Gall[122Gof[125Git[128Ggoes[133Gand[137Gthe[141Gbranch[148Gwon't[154Gbring[160Git[163Gback.[169GThe[173Gonly[178Greproducible[191Gparts[197Gare[201Gthe[205Gschema[212G([38;2;177;185;249mdb/setup.py[39m,[226G[38;2;177;185;249mmigrate_embed_dim.py[39m)[248Gand[252Gthe[2C[1Bingest[10Gscripts.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThird place — the vault[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BThe[7G7[9Gconflict[18Gresolutions[30Gare[34Gin[37G[38;2;177;185;249m~/Documents/Obsidian/Main Vault[39m,[70Ga[72G[1mseparate git repo on [38;2;177;185;249mmain[22m[39m.[99GSomething[109Gauto-commits[122Git[125G([38;2;177;185;249mc7f9d09 vault backup: 2026-08-16 20:20:25[39m),[170Gso[173Gthey're[181Gcommitted[191Gthere[197Gand[201Gno[204Gmarkers[212Gremain[219Gin[222GHEAD.[228GThat's[235Ga[237Gdifferent[247Grepo[2C[1Bfrom [38;2;177;185;249mcapillaries[39m and moves[30Gindep[36Gndently.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhat I'd do[1B[22m[K[2C[1BCommit[10Gthe[14Gbranch[21G—[23Git's[28Ga[30Glot[34Gof[37Guncommitted[49Gwork[54Gand[58Gseveral[66Gchanges[74Gwere[79Ghard-won[88Gcorrections[100Gthat[105Gwould[111Gbe[114Gtedious[122Gto[125Greconstruct.[138GI[140Ghaven't[148Gcommitted[158Ganything[167Gbecause[175Gyou[179Ghaven't[187Gasked[193Gme[196Gto.[1B[K[2C[1BWorth[9Gdeciding[18Gseparately:[30Gwhether[38Gthe[42Gskill-step[53Gwiring[60Gshould[67Gbe[70Greproducible[83Gfrom[88Gcode[93Grather[100Gthan[105Gliving[112Gonly[117Gin[120GPostgres.[130GRight[136Gnow[140G[38;2;177;185;249minsert_db[150G[39min[153G[38;2;177;185;249mscripts/ingest_public.py[178G[39mstill[184Ghardcodes[194G[38;2;177;185;249msteps '[]'::jsonb[212G[39m—[214GI[216Gwired[222Gthe[226Gsteps[232Gwith[237Ga[239Gone-off[247Gscript,[1B [3Gso re-running that[23Gngest would empty them again. Folding that logic into th[80G script[88Gis the difference betwe[112Gn "fixed" and "fixed reproducibly."[2B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GB[5Gked[9Gfor 1m 1s[39m[K[2B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mSkill step wiring should be the same as prompt step wiring[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                  [2B[49m[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mRight — that means it[25Gbelongs[33Gin[36G[38;2;177;185;249mingest_public.py[39m,[54Gidempotent[65Gand[69Gre-runnable,[82Gnot[86Ga[88Gone-off.[97GLet[101Gme[104Gread[109Gthe[113Gcurrent[121Gskills[128Gpath.[2B [3G[38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m2[22m shell commands [25G[39m[K[2B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mNow I see it — the script[29G[3mdoes[34G[23mtry[38Gto[41Gwire[46Gsteps,[53Gand[57Git's[62Gthe[66Gsource[73Gof[76Gthe[80Gbug[84GI[86Gfixed[92Gby[95Ghand:[101Gline[106G296[110Gsets[115G[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_id[125G[39mto[128Ga[130G[1mfilename stem[22m,[145Gnot[149Ga[151GUUID.[157GThat's[164Gexactly[172Gwhat[177G[38;2;177;185;249mLLM Build & Tune Analyzer[203G[39mhad.[208GMaking[215Git[218Gmatch[224Gthe[228Gprompt[235Gpath.[2B [3G[38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m1[22m shell command [24G[39m[K[2B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mNow running it end to end — which[38Gls[41G prove[49Git's[54Greproducible[67Grather[74Gthan[79Ga[81Gone-off.[1B[K[2C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m2[22m shell commands [5C[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mIdempotent. One flaw left though — the [38;2;177;185;249mDELETE[39m at the top churns[67Gevery[73Gpublic[80Gprompt's[89GUUID[94Gon[97Geach[102Grun,[107Gso[110G[38;2;177;185;249mserving_log[122G[39mand[126G[38;2;177;185;249mgolden_examples[142G[39mreferences[1