───────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┘[2C[2BTwo bugs fixed on the way:[K[6C[2B[1mskill [38;2;177;185;249mDEL[17GT[19G[39m raised [38;2;177;185;249mForeignKeyViolation[22m[39m — [38;2;177;185;249mskills.skill_sessions[39m referenc[80Gs [38;2;177;185;249mskills.skills[39m, so any skill that had ever run couldn't be re-ingested.[153GThat's what blocked my first[182Grestore[190Gattempt.[199GUpsert on [38;2;177;185;249mslug[214G[39mavoid[221Git.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe prompts [38;2;177;185;249mDELETE[39m churned every UUID per run.[50G[22mClearing[59Gand[63Gre-inserting[76Gregenerated[88Gall[92G67[95Gpublic[102G[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_id[39ms,[114Gbreaking[123G[38;2;177;185;249mserving_log[39m,[136G[38;2;177;185;249mgolden_examples[39m,[153Gand[157Gany[161G[38;2;177;185;249mskills.steps[174G[39mfrom[179Gan[182Gearlier[190Grun.[195GNow[199Git[202Gupserts[210Gand[214Gprunes[221Gorphans[229Gby[232Gtitle[238Gat[241Gthe[245Gend[249G—[251Gthe[2C[1Bsame shape[14Gas[17Gthe[21Gvault[27Gingest's[36G[38;2;177;185;249mprune_orphans[39m,[51Gbut[55Gscoped[62Gso[65Gvault[71Grows[76Gare[80Gnever[86Gtouched.[2C[2B[1mVerified[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1Brun[7G1[9G→[11Gmd5[15Gof[18Gpublic[25Gprompt[32Gids:[37G9e942009020529378301e26e9a3d1df1[2C[1Brun 2 → md5[15Gof public prompt ids: 9e942[43G09020529378301e26e9a3d1df1[K[2C[2BId[6Gmpotent, IDs stable. F[29Gnal[33Gstate: 1 025[46Gprompts, 2 081 chunks, all embedded, [1m6 skills wired, 0 dead step references.[123G[22mTests 102 passed / 4 failed[151G—[153Gthe[157Gsame[162Gfour[167Ggolden[174Gfailures[183Gthroughout.[3C[2Bhe[7Gstate i[15G now[20Greproducible from[38Gs[40Gurce: [38;2;177;185;249mpython3 scripts/ingest_p[71Gblic.py --db-only[39m rebuilds every[104Gskill's steps from [38;2;177;185;249mpublic_prompts/skills/[39m.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BTwo[7Gthings[14Gstill[20Gnot[